# HARDENED 2026-09-06 — only read by `vercel deploy` from a terminal.
#
# Git-based deploys ignore this file entirely: Vercel clones the repo, so it
# only ever sees what is committed. This exists for the CLI path, which uploads
# the working directory as it stands — and that directory carries three .next
# builds, node_modules and any packaged desktop output, which came to 127MB and
# died on Vercel's 100MB upload limit the first time it was tried.
#
# Everything here is either committed-and-rebuilt-on-Vercel or local-only.
node_modules
.next
dist
out
release
release.noindex
.env*.local
